*.sh text eol=lf
# The patch in tools/ort-portable/patches/ must be applied byte-for-byte: `patch --binary` compares
# bytes, so a checkout that converts it (Windows with core.autocrlf) makes its hunks fail.
*.patch text eol=lf

# Keep the language bar about the app: the marketing videos and the website are not counted
marketing/** linguist-documentation
site/** linguist-documentation
